{
  "poems": [
    {
      "id": "poem_jingyesi",
      "title": "静夜思",
      "author": "李白",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "categories": [
        "night",
        "family"
      ],
      "illustration": "img:poem_jingyesi",
      "lines": [
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_jingyesi",
          "order": 0,
          "text": "床前明月光",
          "pinyin": "chuáng qián míng yuè guāng"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_jingyesi",
          "order": 1,
          "text": "疑是地上霜",
          "pinyin": "yí shì dì shàng shuāng"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_jingyesi",
          "order": 2,
          "text": "举头望明月",
          "pinyin": "jǔ tóu wàng míng yuè"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_jingyesi",
          "order": 3,
          "text": "低头思故乡",
          "pinyin": "dī tóu sī gù xiāng"
        }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_jingyesi",
          "target": "明月",
          "explanation": "明亮的月亮。"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_jingyesi",
          "target": "疑",
          "explanation": "好像、似乎。"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_jingyesi",
          "target": "举头",
          "explanation": "抬起头。"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_jingyesi",
          "target": "思",
          "explanation": "想念、思念。"
        }
      ],
      "kid_summary": "晚上，诗人看到窗外明亮的月光，以为地上铺了一层白霜。他抬起头看看月亮，又低下头，想起了自己的家乡。",
      "sort_order": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "poem_yong_e",
      "title": "咏鹅",
      "author": "骆宾王",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "categories": [
        "nature",
        "daily"
      ],
      "illustration": "img:poem_yong_e",
      "lines": [
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_yong_e",
          "order": 0,
          "text": "鹅，鹅，鹅",
          "pinyin": "é, é, é"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_yong_e",
          "order": 1,
          "text": "曲项向天歌",
          "pinyin": "qū xiàng xiàng tiān gē"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_yong_e",
          "order": 2,
          "text": "白毛浮绿水",
          "pinyin": "bái máo fú lǜ shuǐ"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_yong_e",
          "order": 3,
          "text": "红掌拨清波",
          "pinyin": "hóng zhǎng bō qīng bō"
        }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_yong_e",
          "target": "咏",
          "explanation": "用诗来描写、歌唱。"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_yong_e",
          "target": "曲项",
          "explanation": "弯着脖子。"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_yong_e",
          "target": "拨",
          "explanation": "划动、拨开。"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_yong_e",
          "target": "清波",
          "explanation": "清清的水波。"
        }
      ],
      "kid_summary": "池塘里有一群大白鹅。它们弯着弯弯的脖子，对着天空嘎嘎地唱歌。雪白的羽毛浮在绿绿的水面上，红红的脚掌划动清清的水波。",
      "sort_order": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "poem_chunxiao",
      "title": "春晓",
      "author": "孟浩然",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "categories": [
        "spring",
        "daily"
      ],
      "illustration": "img:poem_chunxiao",
      "lines": [
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_chunxiao",
          "order": 0,
          "text": "春眠不觉晓",
          "pinyin": "chūn mián bù jué xiǎo"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_chunxiao",
          "order": 1,
          "text": "处处闻啼鸟",
          "pinyin": "chù chù wén tí niǎo"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_chunxiao",
          "order": 2,
          "text": "夜来风雨声",
          "pinyin": "yè lái fēng yǔ shēng"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_chunxiao",
          "order": 3,
          "text": "花落知多少",
          "pinyin": "huā luò zhī duō shǎo"
        }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_chunxiao",
          "target": "晓",
          "explanation": "天刚亮的时候。"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_chunxiao",
          "target": "闻",
          "explanation": "听见。"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_chunxiao",
          "target": "夜来",
          "explanation": "昨天夜里。"
        }
      ],
      "kid_summary": "春天的夜里睡得香，一觉醒来天已经亮了。到处都能听到小鸟叽叽喳喳地唱歌。诗人想起昨天夜里的风声雨声，不知道有多少花瓣被吹落了呀。",
      "sort_order": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "poem_minnong",
      "title": "悯农",
      "author": "李绅",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "categories": [
        "daily"
      ],
      "illustration": "img:poem_minnong",
      "lines": [
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_minnong",
          "order": 0,
          "text": "锄禾日当午",
          "pinyin": "chú hé rì dāng wǔ"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_minnong",
          "order": 1,
          "text": "汗滴禾下土",
          "pinyin": "hàn dī hé xià tǔ"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_minnong",
          "order": 2,
          "text": "谁知盘中餐",
          "pinyin": "shuí zhī pán zhōng cān"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_minnong",
          "order": 3,
          "text": "粒粒皆辛苦",
          "pinyin": "lì lì jiē xīn kǔ"
        }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_minnong",
          "target": "锄禾",
          "explanation": "给禾苗锄草松土。"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_minnong",
          "target": "日当午",
          "explanation": "太阳正当头的中午。"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_minnong",
          "target": "皆",
          "explanation": "都是。"
        }
      ],
      "kid_summary": "中午太阳火辣辣的，农民伯伯还在田里干活，汗水一滴一滴落进泥土里。我们盘子里的每一粒米饭，都是他们辛辛苦苦种出来的，所以要爱惜粮食，不剩饭哦。",
      "sort_order": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "poem_guanqueque",
      "title": "登鹳雀楼",
      "author": "王之涣",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "categories": [
        "nature"
      ],
      "illustration": "img:poem_guanqueque",
      "lines": [
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_guanqueque",
          "order": 0,
          "text": "白日依山尽",
          "pinyin": "bái rì yī shān jìn"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_guanqueque",
          "order": 1,
          "text": "黄河入海流",
          "pinyin": "huáng hé rù hǎi liú"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_guanqueque",
          "order": 2,
          "text": "欲穷千里目",
          "pinyin": "yù qióng qiān lǐ mù"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_guanqueque",
          "order": 3,
          "text": "更上一层楼",
          "pinyin": "gèng shàng yī céng lóu"
        }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_guanqueque",
          "target": "依山尽",
          "explanation": "靠着山慢慢落下。"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_guanqueque",
          "target": "欲",
          "explanation": "想要。"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_guanqueque",
          "target": "穷",
          "explanation": "看尽、看遍。"
        }
      ],
      "kid_summary": "太阳挨着大山慢慢落下去，黄河朝着大海哗哗地流。想看到更远更远的风景，就要再爬上一层楼。做事情也一样，站得高，才能看得远。",
      "sort_order": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "poem_cunju",
      "title": "村居",
      "author": "高鼎",
      "dynasty": "清",
      "categories": [
        "spring",
        "daily"
      ],
      "illustration": "img:poem_cunju",
      "lines": [
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_cunju",
          "order": 0,
          "text": "草长莺飞二月天",
          "pinyin": "cǎo zhǎng yīng fēi èr yuè tiān"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_cunju",
          "order": 1,
          "text": "拂堤杨柳醉春烟",
          "pinyin": "fú dī yáng liǔ zuì chūn yān"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_cunju",
          "order": 2,
          "text": "儿童散学归来早",
          "pinyin": "ér tóng sàn xué guī lái zǎo"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_cunju",
          "order": 3,
          "text": "忙趁东风放纸鸢",
          "pinyin": "máng chèn dōng fēng fàng zhǐ yuān"
        }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_cunju",
          "target": "莺",
          "explanation": "一种会唱歌的小鸟，黄莺。"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_cunju",
          "target": "拂堤",
          "explanation": "轻轻擦过河堤。"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_cunju",
          "target": "纸鸢",
          "explanation": "风筝。"
        }
      ],
      "kid_summary": "二月里，小草长出来了，黄莺在天上飞。杨柳枝轻轻拂着河堤，在春天的雾气里跳舞。放学后，孩子们赶快跑回家，趁着东风放起了风筝。",
      "sort_order": 6
    },
    {
