          "text": "千山鸟飞绝",
          "pinyin": "qiān shān niǎo fēi jué"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_jiangxue",
          "order": 1,
          "text": "万径人踪灭",
          "pinyin": "wàn jìng rén zōng miè"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_jiangxue",
          "order": 2,
          "text": "孤舟蓑笠翁",
          "pinyin": "gū zhōu suō lì wēng"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_jiangxue",
          "order": 3,
          "text": "独钓寒江雪",
          "pinyin": "dú diào hán jiāng xuě"
        }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_jiangxue",
          "target": "绝",
          "explanation": "没有了、绝迹。"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_jiangxue",
          "target": "蓑笠翁",
          "explanation": "穿蓑衣、戴斗笠的老爷爷。"
        },
        {
          "poem_id": "poem_jiangxue",
          "target": "独",
          "explanation": "独自、一个人。"
        }
      ],
      "kid_summary": "大雪天，山上没有小鸟飞，路上没有行人走。只有一位老爷爷，披着蓑衣、戴着斗笠，坐在小船上，独自在寒冷的江面上钓鱼。",
      "sort_order": 8
    },
    {
